                "review_id": "1070334967",
                "title": "Hotel without air conditioning, food in bad condition, terrible solutions... in short.... A horror movie",
                "review_text": "The hotel is a disaster, the air conditioning doesn't work even in the rooms, the food is horrible (lack of refrigeration, little variety, cold coffee and warm juices, not to mention that there is no air conditioning and that the restaurant is also full of flies, a disaster) in addition to the fact that they cannot agree on how to tell lies, since the night before I reported that the air conditioning was not working, in the morning I get up and go to the public relations department to complain after having contacted my agency, everyone at the hotel knew that the air conditioning was not working, and while sitting there they called from my agency to the front desk to ask if it was true that they had climate control problems to which the receptionist stated that the climate control was working perfectly, then I receive the message from the travel agency telling me this and while sitting there I confront them and they tell me that the receptionist did not have that information, which she clearly did have since she made a key for me the day before to see another room that had the same problem, it is a disaster as a hotel and honestly they should coordinate better to tell lies, but mainly they should stop playing with the guests' departures, it is preferable that they tell the guest that they have broken equipment or whatever and that they should go to another hotel, rather than having them wait like a fool there and laughing at them..... Just to highlight something, Carlos who brings room service is very kind, as is the maintenance guy, and the cleaning ladies who assisted me were more than pleasant, it is the only good thing I take away from that hotel, I hope they know how to value the staff they have more, instead of having them working in subhuman conditions….. one last thing to highlight, they brought me a fan at the last minute so it would blow air on me ….. a shame that they cut the electricity every 5 min …. I find the solution pathetic….",
