                "title": "Incredible experience in Havana",
                "review_text": "I stayed 2 nights in the hotel with a group of friends and was amazing the structure of the hotel. There is a boulevard with several restaurants, a cigar shop, a cafeteria, a garden that gives the impression that we are in a park. Beautiful.\nBesides the pool which is huge, clean, with a wet bar and overlooking the sea. \nThe hotel is further away from the historic center but is in a super quiet region and close to a street where there are several bars/restaurants.\nManager Negrin is always present to ensure everything is perfect and is a loved one.\nThe manha cafe is full and the attendants are kind.  \nThe apartments are spacious, clean, have coffee in capsule, sea view. Top!\nI'd definitely come back.",
                "language": "en",
                "original_language": "pt",
                "review_images": null,
